Now all there is to do is to place one `TAG_PrintPlayerPositionEntity` entity in the world and see the player's position printed in logs!

> **Note:** In order for the entity to appear in World Editor, scripts must be compiled and reloaded *via* **Compile & Reload Scripts** function in **Build** tab ( `⇧ Shift` + `F7` ).

